(Berlin depot report for May.) Tj T*
(The Berlin depot handled 4200 parcels in May.) Tj T*
(Staffing at the Berlin depot rose by six people after the spring hiring round.) Tj T*
(Shift leads at the Berlin depot reviewed loading bays, sorting belts and the) Tj T*
(returns desk each morning. Drivers collected routes from the Berlin dispatch) Tj T*
(office and scanned every parcel at the gate. Customers in the Berlin area could) Tj T*
(follow their deliveries in the tracking system, and the Berlin supervisors wrote a) Tj T*
(short summary of delays at the end of every week. Shift leads at the Berlin depot) Tj T*
(reviewed loading bays, sorting belts and the returns desk each morning. Drivers) Tj T*
(collected routes from the Berlin dispatch office and scanned every parcel at the) Tj T*
(gate. Customers in the Berlin area could follow their deliveries in the tracking) Tj T*
(system, and the Berlin supervisors wrote a short summary of delays at the end of) Tj T*
(every week.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
